Reports from each release live here:
- test-run-<date>.md (vitest + playwright summary)
- coverage-<date>.html / .txt
- sast-<date>.json (semgrep / eslint-security output)
- audit-<date>.json (npm audit output)
- dast-<date>.html (ZAP report)
- a11y-<date>.html (axe + manual screen-reader notes)
- perf-<date>.md (k6 / autocannon output)
- restore-<date>.md (backup-restore drill result)
- known-issues-<date>.md (severity-tagged list)
